\subsection{PMF (Probability Mass Function)}{

Let \eqn{\eta \in \mathbb R} be the linear predictor (for example \eqn{\eta =
x^\top \beta}), let cutpoints \eqn{c = (c_1, \dots,c_{K-1})} satisfy \eqn{c_1
